# Finding 4 (AUDITOR GAP — pod_audit did not flag this; cross-check found it):
# storage description prof:hasResource -> /vault/meta/profiles/procedure returns 404.
# The procedure profile descriptor was renamed to profiles/howto. The overlay
# manifest installs profiles/howto (manifest.ttl line 101); the deployed Pod
# serves profiles/howto (200). The static void-description.json still advertises
# the old profiles/procedure name. (A stale procedure.ttl whose subject is
# profiles/procedure also lingers in the overlay but is NOT installed by the
# manifest — a repo-hygiene leftover.)

<urn:uuid:16f7d127-f445-4750-9fa7-fd22fbfade09>
    a as:Announce, mem:RealignAction, prov:Activity ;
    as:actor <urn:agent:claude-code> ;
    as:target </vault/wiki/working/curator-proposals/> ;
    as:object <https://pod.vardeman.me/vault/.well-known/solid> ;
    prov:wasAssociatedWith <urn:agent:claude-code> ;
    prov:used <https://pod.vardeman.me/vault/meta/profiles/howto> ;             # ground truth: live descriptor (200)
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://pod.vardeman.me/vault/meta/profiles/procedure> ; # stale target (404)
    mem:stalenessClass mem:MovedTarget ;
    mem:rationale "prof:hasResource names /vault/meta/profiles/procedure which 404s. The live descriptor for schema:HowTo procedure pages is /vault/meta/profiles/howto (200), installed by manifest.ttl line 101. The procedure profile was renamed to howto; static config was not updated. Realign by renaming the hasResource value procedure->howto. Secondary repo-hygiene note: overlays/wiki-memory/profiles/procedure.ttl is an uninstalled leftover (subject profiles/procedure) and should be removed so the overlay has a single source of truth. Not auto-detected by pod_audit (prof:hasResource targets not cross-checked)." ;
    as:published "2026-05-23T22:33:41Z"^^xsd:dateTime .

# --- Concrete proposed change (REPO-side) ---
# File: css/config/void-description.json
# In the StaticStorageDescriber block at lines 300-309, change the term value:
#   FROM: "https://pod.vardeman.me/vault/meta/profiles/procedure"
#   TO:   "https://pod.vardeman.me/vault/meta/profiles/howto"
# (and update its "comment" from "procedure profile descriptor" to "howto profile descriptor")
#
# Secondary (repo hygiene, optional): delete overlays/wiki-memory/profiles/procedure.ttl
# — it is not referenced by manifest.ttl (which installs profiles/howto).
